<section class="card mb-4"><div class="card-body"><h2 class="h6">Security</h2><p class="form-text">Register a passkey using your device's fingerprint, face unlock or a hardware security key. Auth Central never receives your biometric data. Passkeys require HTTPS, or localhost for development.</p><p class="form-text">Confirm security changes with your current password, or your current authenticator/recovery code if enabled. Accounts without a password can verify an existing passkey first.</p><div class="form-field"><label class="form-label" for="securityPassword">Current password</label><input id="securityPassword" type="password" class="form-control" autocomplete="current-password"></div><div class="form-field mt-3"><label class="form-label" for="securityCode">Authenticator or recovery code</label><input id="securityCode" type="text" class="form-control" autocomplete="one-time-code" maxlength="64"></div><button type="button" id="securityVerifyPasskey" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm mt-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-key" aria-hidden="true"></i> Verify existing passkey</button><p class="form-text mt-3">If you have no password or passkey yet, use Forgot password to set a password before your first security enrollment.</p><h3 class="h6 mt-4">Passkeys</h3><ul class="list-unstyled" id="passkeyList"><% (dashboard.security?.passkeys || []).forEach(key => { %><li class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-3 mb-2"><span><%= key.name %> · <%= h.fmtDate(key.createdAt) %></span><button type="button" class="btn btn-text theme-danger btn-sm" data-remove-passkey="<%= key._id %>">Remove</button></li><% }) %></ul><label class="form-label" for="passkeyName">Name this passkey</label><input id="passkeyName" class="form-control" maxlength="64" placeholder="My phone or security key"><button type="button" id="registerPasskey" class="btn btn-outline mt-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-fingerprint" aria-hidden="true"></i> Register passkey</button><h3 class="h6 mt-4">Authenticator app</h3><p id="totpState"><%= dashboard.security?.totpEnabled ? 'Enabled. Sign-in requires an authenticator or recovery code after your password, passkey or Google sign-in.' : 'Not enabled. Add an authenticator for a second sign-in step.' %></p><button type="button" id="setupTotp" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" <%= dashboard.security?.totpEnabled ? 'hidden' : '' %>><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved" aria-hidden="true"></i> Set up authenticator</button><button type="button" id="removeTotp" class="btn btn-outline theme-danger btn-sm" <%= dashboard.security?.totpEnabled ? '' : 'hidden' %>>Remove authenticator</button><div id="totpSetup" class="mt-3" hidden><p>Scan this QR code in your authenticator app, or enter the setup key manually. Keep it private.</p><img id="totpQr" width="220" height="220" alt="Authenticator setup QR code"><p class="mono" id="totpSecret"></p><label class="form-label" for="totpConfirmCode">Code from your app</label><input id="totpConfirmCode" class="form-control" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code" maxlength="6"><button type="button" id="confirmTotp" class="btn theme-brand btn-solid mt-3">Confirm authenticator</button><button type="button" id="cancelTotp" class="btn btn-text mt-3">Cancel</button></div><div id="recoveryPanel" class="mt-3" hidden><h3 class="h6">Save these recovery codes</h3><p class="form-text">Each code works once instead of an authenticator code. Store them in your password manager. They are shown only now.</p><pre id="recoveryCodes"></pre><button type="button" id="dismissRecovery" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">I saved the codes</button></div><p id="securityStatus" class="form-text mt-3" role="status"></p></div></section>
